node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
.vite

# Playwright Component-Testing (T-187c): the vite build cache and per-run
# artifacts. The harness (playwright/index.html, playwright/index.ts) IS
# tracked — only the generated .cache and results dirs are ignored.
playwright/.cache
test-results/
dist-paint-guard/

# Screenshots written by the recon specs in visual-guards/ (te4ae-recon writes
# recon-out/<story>-<width>-<variant>.png on every run). Throwaway measurement
# output that lands in the working tree UNIGNORED, so a routine `git add -A`
# sweeps dozens of them into a commit — 48 of them were sitting in one worktree
# when this was written, caught only by a human manifest review.
#
# Scoped to *.png ON PURPOSE, not the whole directory: recon-out/ already holds
# TRACKED hand-written notes (T-e4ae-*.md), and ignoring the directory wholesale
# would make every future note there need `git add -f` while its neighbours stay
# tracked — a trap for the next person. Only the generated images are ignored.
recon-out/*.png
